abstract: >-
  Source code for constructing event-level seismotectonic characteristics,
  evaluating their association with earthquake magnitude using random forests,
  and assessing the spatial identification ability of ConvLSTM models.
keywords:
  - earthquake forecasting
  - spatial seismicity
  - seismotectonic characteristics
  - random forest
  - ConvLSTM
